/my image.png

# Generated hero images. The SVGs are committed (332 KB, deterministic, and
# they are what the pages actually render). The PNGs are only there because
# social platforms refuse SVG — they are 7 MB, they are rebuilt in prebuild by
# scripts/generate-images.js, and if that step is ever skipped the prerenderer
# falls back to /og-image.png rather than emitting a broken preview.
/public/img/**/*.png
